   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> Tech-built<br><strong>Type:</strong> Invented Tech Upgrade (Upgrade DV21; material cost: the shield's cost + 500eb)<br><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p>+5 shield HP (automated), but the shield counts as Expensive for repairs and maintenance (Breaking Your Stuff DLC).</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>Shield Attachments and Enhancements follow the Armor Attachment and Enhancement rules, but for Bulletproof Shields, including cyberware ones; not for vehicle Bulletproof Glass. Corgo's optional rule: a Bulletproof Shield with HP left puts its wielder in Cover and counts as a 2x2m/yds piece of Cover against Suppressive Fire, which they may share with one adjacent character.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Shields).</em></p>"
